    "/apis/v1/seranking/google-domain-overview": {
      "get": {
        "description": "returns an `organic` and an `adv` block. /v1/domain/overview/worldwide is the same job aggregated across every country at the same price, and /v1/domain/overview/history returns the traffic/keyword trend.\n\n<!-- aisa-pricing:start -->\nUsage-based billing; Default request estimate: $0.0179 USD (not a fixed price). Account-specific pricing and final settlement may differ.\n<!-- aisa-pricing:end -->",
